  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Dec 101.02 Scope of Rules. These rules shall govern the proceedings before the nuclear decommissioning finance committee in the conduct of its statutory responsibilities.\n\nSource. #9143, eff 4-25-08",
